  "prefLabel": "Rev 803.02 Transfers Under a Plan of Reorganization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 803.02 Transfers Under a Plan of Reorganization. The tax imposed by RSA 78-B shall not apply to transfers under a plan of reorganization confirmed under 11 USC section 1129.\n\nSource. #1170, eff 5-23-78; #1809, eff 9-9-8l; ss by #2154, eff 10-11-82; ss by #2822, eff 8-17-84; ss by #5300, eff 12-26-91; ss and moved by #6691, eff 2-21-98 (formerly Rev 803.03); rpld by #7717, eff 6-22-02\n\nNew. #8579, eff 3-08-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
